    {
      "qid": "605c3ce981a05e5dbb990baf",
      "n": 3,
      "type": "mcq",
      "concept": "Alphabet/Word Test",
      "confidence": "high",
      "marks_pos": 1.0,
      "marks_neg": 0.25,
      "question": "Select the set in which numbers are related in the same way as are the numbers of the following set.\n\n(16, 24, 30)",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "1",
          "text": "(18, 27, 45)"
        },
        {
          "label": "2",
          "text": "(14, 21, 38)"
        },
        {
          "label": "3",
          "text": "(22, 32, 40)"
        },
        {
          "label": "4",
          "text": "(40, 60, 75)"
        }
      ],
      "correct": "4",
      "solution": "The pattern followed here is \n\n**1st number × 1.5 = 2nd number , and 2nd number × 1.25 = 3rd number.**\n\nUsing this pattern,\n\n**16 × 1.5 = 24, 24 × 1.25 = 30**\n\n**Similarly,**\n\n**40 × 1.5 = 60, 60 × 1.25 = 75**\n\nSo, (40, 60, 75) is related in the same way as are the numbers in the above set.\n\nHence, **option 4** is the correct answer.",
      "tags": [
        "Letter and Number Based"
      ]
    },
